# .work.biz/ — Project Memory

| Path | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `gates.md` | Readiness ledger — which gates are PASS. Every gated skill reads it before working |
| `context/HANDOFF.md` | Session bookmark |
| `plans/NEXT.md` | Tactical next action |
| `plans/UNKNOWNS.md` | Open questions |
| `pipeline/pipeline_tracker.md` | Sales pipeline |
| `pipeline/outreach-cadence.md` | Outreach sequence and follow-up rules |
| `research/research_index.md` | Research evidence |
| `strategy/README.md` | Strategy artifact index |
| `decisions/DECISIONS.md` | Decision ledger: what was decided, the falsifiable expected outcome, what happened. Scored by `@biz-review quarterly` |
| `reference/CONTENT_STATUS.md` | Publish/status tracker for all content |
| `reference/BRAND_STATUS.md` | Brand audit history and overhaul log |
| `reference/VOICE_PROFILE.md` | How you sound. Binding for every content skill, every platform |
| `reference/VOICE_RETRO.md` | What the draft said vs what you changed. Falling edit counts mean the voice rules work |
| `reference/OPERATOR_PROFILE.md` | Your skills, proof points, constraints, risk, career stage. Filled by `@biz-strategy career` |
| `reference/PROJECTS.md` | Proof-point bank: real projects with numbers. Content, proposals, and calls draw on it |
| `pipeline/<platform>-tracker.md` | Per-platform performance and conversations. Created on first publish |
| `drafts/` | In-progress drafts |
| `ideas/` | Generated content pieces, one subdir per content type, one directory per piece |
| `ideas.archive/` | Published pieces, moved from `ideas/` by `@biz-archive` with the structure mirrored |
| `reference/` | Other project reference files (VISUAL_GUIDE.md, etc.) |
| `touch-scope` | Declared change scope for the current work session (session-local, not tracked) |
